            <div xml:id="d51">

                <pb facs="0159" n="35" sameAs="frus:frus1921v01/pg35"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A4/25: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-07-18T17:00:00+09:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 18, 1921—5
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received July 18—10:40
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>251. Referring to last paragraph of my 245, July 13. The Japanese Government,
                    according to all indications, will unquestionably accept the invitation to
                    attend the conference. …</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
